            Suppose:
            
            ```bash
            kubectl top pod
            ```
            
            Complete flow:
            
            ```text
            kubectl
            
            ↓
            
            API Server
            
            ↓
            
            Authentication
            
            ↓
            
            Authorization
            
            ↓
            
            Aggregation Layer
            
            ↓
            
            APIService Lookup
            
            ↓
            
            Metrics Server
            
            ↓
            
            Collect Metrics
            
            ↓
            
            Return Response
            
            ↓
            
            API Server
            
            ↓
            
            kubectl
            ```
            
