            # Aggregated API vs CRD
            
            Many engineers confuse these concepts.
            
            ---
            
            ## CRD
            
            Adds:
            
            ```text
            New Resource Types
            ```
            
            Example:
            
            ```text
            RedisCluster
            
            KafkaCluster
            
            Database
            ```
            
            Stored in:
            
            ```text
            etcd
            ```
            
            ---
            
            ## Aggregated API
            
            Adds:
            
            ```text
            New API Endpoints
            ```
            
            Example:
            
            ```text
            metrics.k8s.io
            
            custom.metrics.k8s.io
            
            external.metrics.k8s.io
            ```
            
            Usually backed by external services.
            
            ---
            
            # Comparison
            
            | Feature | CRD | Aggregated API |
            |----------|-----|----------------|
            | Adds new Kubernetes objects | ✅ | ❌ |
            | Adds new API endpoints | ❌ | ✅ |
            | Stored in etcd | ✅ | Optional |
            | Own API Server | ❌ | ✅ |
            | Own Database | ❌ | ✅ |
            | Used by Metrics Server | ❌ | ✅ |
            
