            # Production Architecture
            
            ```text
                                    Kubernetes Cluster
            
                                          Client
            
                                             │
                                             ▼
                                    kube-apiserver
                                             │
                             ┌───────────────┼────────────────┐
                             │               │                │
                             ▼               ▼                ▼
                      metrics.k8s.io  custom.metrics  external.metrics
                             │               │                │
                             ▼               ▼                ▼
                     Metrics Server   Prometheus Adapter   KEDA Adapter
                             │               │                │
                             ▼               ▼                ▼
                         kubelets      Prometheus       External Systems
                                                            │
                                              Kafka • RabbitMQ • SQS
            ```
            
