            Yes.
            
            CRDs can include OpenAPI schemas so Kubernetes can validate custom resources.
            
            ---
            
            ### Q9. Why is OpenAPI useful for client SDK generation?
            
            Because the schema provides a complete machine-readable description of every API, allowing tools to generate strongly typed clients automatically.
            
