            Example:
            
            ```json
            {
              "versions": [
                "v1"
              ]
            }
            ```
            
            ---
            
            ## Named API Discovery
            
            ```text
            GET /apis
            ```
            
            Returns:
            
            Every named API Group.
            
            Example:
            
            ```text
            apps
            
            batch
            
            autoscaling
            
            networking.k8s.io
            
            storage.k8s.io
            
            coordination.k8s.io
