            > **Goal:** Understand how Kubernetes delivers real-time cluster changes using the Watch API, how Watch Events work, what Bookmarks are, how the Watch Cache improves performance, how `resourceVersion` enables consistent event streams, and how clients recover from disconnections.
            >
