            # Chapter 8 — Informers
            
            > **Goal:** Understand why Informers exist, how they build upon the Watch API, and how components like the Reflector, DeltaFIFO, Local Cache, and Event Handlers work together to create Kubernetes' highly scalable event-driven architecture.
