            ↓
            
            10 Pod Caches
            
            ↓
            
            10 Copies
            ```
            
            With Shared Informers:
            
            ```text
            10 Controllers
            
            ↓
            
            1 Shared Cache
            
            ↓
            
            1 Copy
            ```
            
