            # Chapter 11 — WorkQueues
            
            > **Goal:** Understand how Kubernetes Controllers reliably process events using WorkQueues, how Rate Limiting prevents API overload, how Retry Logic ensures eventual consistency, how Delayed Queues schedule future work, and how Kubernetes handles failures without losing events.
            >
            > By the end of this chapter, you'll understand:
            >
            > - Why WorkQueues exist
            > - How WorkQueues work
            > - Named Queues in client-go
