            > **Goal:** Understand the architecture of **client-go**, the official Kubernetes Go SDK. Learn how RESTClient, Discovery Client, Dynamic Client, Typed Client, SharedInformerFactory, and Controller Patterns work together to build Kubernetes controllers, operators, and automation.
