            # What is controller-runtime?
            
            controller-runtime is a Go framework that simplifies building Kubernetes Controllers and Operators by providing reusable abstractions for:
            
            - Clients
            - Caches
            - Controllers
            - Reconcilers
            - Watches
            - Webhooks
            - Metrics
            - Leader Election
            
            Instead of manually composing client-go primitives, developers work with higher-level components.
            
            ---
            
            # Component Overview
            
            ```text
            controller-runtime
            
            │
            
            ├── Manager
            
            ├── Cache
            
            ├── Client
            
            ├── Controller
            
            ├── Reconciler
            
            ├── Builder
            
            ├── Webhooks
            
            ├── Health Checks
            
            └── Leader Election
            ```
            
            Every Operator built with Kubebuilder uses these components.
            
            ---
            
            # Manager
            
            The **Manager** is the central coordinator.
            
            Think of it as:
            
            ```text
            Operating System
            
            for
            
            Controllers
            ```
            
            It starts and manages:
            
            - Cache
            - Client
            - Controllers
            - Webhooks
            - Metrics Server
            - Health Probes
            - Leader Election
            
            Everything runs under one Manager.
            
            ---
            
            # Manager Architecture
            
            ```text
                            Manager
            
                               │
            
                   ┌───────────┼────────────┐
            
                   ▼           ▼            ▼
            
                 Cache      Client     Controller
            
                                            │
            
                                       Reconciler
            ```
            
            Every component receives shared dependencies from the Manager.
            
            ---
            
            # Why Does Manager Exist?
            
            Without a Manager:
            
            Every controller would create:
            
            ```text
            Own Cache
            
            Own Client
            
            Own Informers
            
            Own Leader Election
            ```
            
            Huge duplication.
            
            With Manager:
            
            ```text
            One Cache
            
            One Client
            
            Many Controllers
            ```
            
            Much more efficient.
            
            ---
            
            # Manager Startup Workflow
            
            When your Operator starts:
            
            ```text
            main()
            
            ↓
            
            Create Manager
            
            ↓
            
            Create Cache
            
            ↓
            
            Create Client
            
            ↓
            
            Register Controllers
            
            ↓
            
