            # Troubleshooting Guide
            
            | Problem | Likely Cause |
            |----------|--------------|
            | Controller doesn't receive events | Watch not registered or Builder configuration incomplete |
            | Reads return stale data | Cache has not synchronized or eventual consistency delay |
            | Duplicate reconciliations | Multiple watched resources legitimately enqueueing the same object |
            | Updates fail with conflicts | ResourceVersion changed; re-read the latest object before updating |
            | High memory usage | Watching too many resource types or large cluster cache footprint |
            
