            # Chapter 1 — etcd Architecture
            
            > **Goal:** Understand the architecture of etcd, why Kubernetes uses it as its primary datastore, how an etcd cluster is organized, how clients communicate with it, how reads and writes flow through the system, and how etcd fits into the Kubernetes Control Plane.
            >
