            # Internal RAFT Architecture
            
            ```text
                             Client
            
                               │
            
                               ▼
            
                            Leader
            
                               │
            
                  ┌────────────┼────────────┐
            
                  ▼            ▼            ▼
            
            Follower A    Follower B   Follower C
            
                  ▲            ▲            ▲
            
                  └──── Heartbeats ─────────┘
            
                  └── Log Replication ───────┘
            ```
            
            ---
            
            # Relationship with Previous Chapter
            
            ```text
            API Server
            
            ↓
            
            etcd
            
            ↓
            
            RAFT
            
            ↓
            
            Consensus
            
            ↓
            
            MVCC
            
            ↓
            
            BoltDB
            
            ↓
            
