            # Historical Reads
            
            One of MVCC's biggest advantages.
            
            Suppose current revision:
            
            ```text
            150
            ```
            
            Database history:
            
            ```text
            Revision 120
            
            ↓
            
            Revision 130
            
            ↓
            
            Revision 140
            
            ↓
            
            Revision 150
            ```
            
            You can ask:
            
            ```text
            Give me data
            
            At Revision 130
            ```
            
            Provided that revision has not yet been compacted.
            
            ---
            
            # Why Historical Reads?
            
            Suppose:
            
            Watch disconnects.
            
            Current revision:
            
            ```text
            200
            ```
            
            Watch last processed:
            
            ```text
            180
            ```
            
            Instead of:
            
            ```text
            Restart Everything
            ```
            
            Watch resumes:
            
            ```text
            Revision 181
            
            ↓
            
            182
            
            ↓
            
            183
            
            ↓
            
            ...
            
            ↓
            
            200
            ```
            
            This is possible because MVCC preserves history until compaction.
            
            ---
            
            # MVCC Timeline
            
            ```text
            Revision 1
            
            Create Pod
            
            ↓
            
            Revision 2
            
            Update Pod
            
            ↓
            
            Revision 3
            
            Scale Deployment
            
            ↓
            
            Revision 4
            
            Delete Service
            
            ↓
            
            Revision 5
            
            Create Secret
            ```
            
            History forms a complete timeline.
            
