            Watch request:
            
            ```text
            Start Watching
            
            Revision 1000
            ```
            
            Server sends:
            
            ```text
            1001
            
            ↓
            
            1002
            
            ↓
            
            1003
            ```
            
            If the watch disconnects,
            
            the client resumes from the last observed `resourceVersion` (or an equivalent revision chosen by the API Server), allowing it to continue from where it left off if the history is still available.
            
