            # Practical Example 2
            
            ## User Session
            
            Create:
            
            ```text
            /session/user456
            ```
            
            Lease:
            
            ```text
            TTL
            
            20 Minutes
            ```
            
            User active:
            
            ```text
            KeepAlive
