            # Leader Lease
            
            Leader Election depends heavily on leases.
            
            Instead of:
            
            ```text
            Leader
            
            Forever
            ```
            
            Leader owns a leased key.
            
            Workflow:
            
            ```text
            Leader
            
            ↓
            
            Lease
            
            ↓
            
            KeepAlive
            
            ↓
            
            Alive
            ```
            
            If KeepAlive stops:
            
            ```text
            Lease Expires
            
            ↓
            
            Leader Key Deleted
            
            ↓
            
            Election Starts
            ```
            
            Leadership is automatically released.
            
            ---
            
            # Kubernetes Leader Election
            
            Many Kubernetes components support leader election.
            
            Examples:
            
            - kube-controller-manager
            - cloud-controller-manager
            - custom controllers
            - Operators
            
            Only one instance actively performs work.
            
            Others wait.
            
            ---
            
            # Leader Election Flow
            
            ```text
            Controller A
            
            ↓
            
            Acquire Lease
            
            ↓
            
            Leader
            
            ↓
            
            KeepAlive
            
            ↓
            
            Leader Running
            
            ---------------------
            
            Crash
            
            ↓
            
            Lease Expires
            
            ↓
            
            Controller B
            
            ↓
            
            Acquire Lease
            
            ↓
            
            New Leader
            ```
            
            No administrator is required.
            
