            Kubernetes exposes a resource:
            
            ```text
            Lease
            ```
            
            API Group:
            
            ```text
            coordination.k8s.io
            ```
            
            Kind:
            
            ```yaml
            Lease
            ```
            
            The API Server stores these objects in etcd like any other resource.
            
            They are widely used for coordination.
            
