            # Node Heartbeats
            
            One of Kubernetes' most important uses.
            
            Every Node periodically updates its Lease object.
            
            Workflow:
            
            ```text
            Node
            
            ↓
            
            Renew Lease
            
            ↓
            
            API Server
            
            ↓
            
            etcd
            
            ↓
            
            Lease Updated
            ```
            
