            # Review: MVCC History
            
            From the previous chapter,
            
            every successful write creates:
            
            ```text
            New Revision
            ```
            
            Example:
            
            ```text
            Revision 1
            
            ↓
            
            Create Pod
            
            ↓
            
            Revision 2
            
            Update Pod
            
            ↓
            
            Revision 3
            
            Update Deployment
            
            ↓
            
            Revision 4
            
            Delete ConfigMap
            
            ↓
            
            Revision 5
            
            Create Secret
            ```
            
            Nothing is immediately removed.
            
            History accumulates.
            
            ---
            
            # Every Update Creates History
            
            Imagine one Pod.
            
            ```text
            Version 1
            
            ↓
            
            Version 2
            
            ↓
            
            Version 3
            
            ↓
            
            Version 4
            
            ↓
            
            Version 5
            ```
            
            MVCC stores all versions.
            
            Not just the newest one.
            
            ---
            
            # Why Keep Old Versions?
            
            Because old versions enable:
            
            - Watches
            - Historical Reads
            - Optimistic Concurrency
            - Transactions
            - Recovery after temporary disconnects
            
            Without history,
            
            these features would not work.
            
            ---
            
            # The Problem
            
            Imagine a busy Kubernetes cluster.
            
            Every second:
            
            ```text
            Pods Created
            
            ↓
            
            Deployments Updated
            
            ↓
            
            Secrets Changed
            
            ↓
            
            Leases Renewed
            
            ↓
            
            Node Heartbeats
            
            ↓
            
            Controllers Updating Status
            ```
            
            Each operation creates:
            
            ```text
            New Revision
            ```
            
            Now imagine:
            
            ```text
            10 Million Revisions
            ```
            
            Then:
            
            ```text
            100 Million Revisions
            ```
            
            Then:
            
            ```text
            1 Billion Revisions
            ```
            
            The history never stops growing.
            
            ---
            
            # Why Compaction Exists
            
            Compaction removes:
            
            ```text
            Old
            
            Unused
            
            Historical Versions
            ```
            
            while preserving:
            
            ```text
            Latest State
            ```
            
            Think of it as:
            
            ```text
            Archive
            
            ↓
            
            Discard Old Drafts
            
            ↓
            
            Keep Final Copy
            ```
            
            ---
            
            # Real-Life Analogy
            
            Suppose you edit a document.
            
            Versions:
            
            ```text
            Draft 1
            
            ↓
            
            Draft 2
            
            ↓
            
            Draft 3
            
            ↓
            
            Draft 4
            
            ↓
            
            Final Version
            ```
            
            After publication,
            
            you may decide:
            
            ```text
            Delete
            
            Old Drafts
            
            Keep Final
            ```
            
            Compaction works similarly.
            
