            # Read Latency
            
            Monitor:
            
            ```text
            Read Duration
            ```
            
            High read latency may indicate:
            
            - Memory pressure
            - Large database
            - Disk contention
            
            ---
            
            # Database Size
            
            Track:
            
            ```text
