            # Why Backup & Restore Matters
            
            One of the most common production incidents is not:
            
            ```text
            Pod Failure
            ```
            
            or
            
            ```text
            Node Failure
            ```
            
            Those are routine Kubernetes events.
            
            The real disaster is:
            
            ```text
            Loss of etcd
            ```
            
            Because etcd stores the **entire desired state** of Kubernetes.
            
            Without etcd,
            
            Kubernetes has no memory.
            
            ---
            
            # Why etcd is the Most Critical Component
            
            Recall the architecture.
            
            ```text
                             User
            
                              │
            
                              ▼
            
                        kubectl apply
            
                              │
            
                              ▼
            
                         API Server
            
                              │
            
                              ▼
            
                            etcd
            
                              │
            
                  Entire Cluster State
            ```
            
            Everything eventually reaches etcd.
            
            Examples:
            
            - Deployments
            - Pods
            - Secrets
            - ConfigMaps
            - RBAC
            - ServiceAccounts
            - CRDs
            - Nodes
            - Network Policies
            - Lease Objects
            
            Lose etcd,
            
            lose the cluster state.
            
            ---
            
            # What Happens Without Backup?
            
            Imagine:
            
            ```text
            SSD Failure
            
            ↓
            
            etcd Database Lost
            
            ↓
            
            API Server Starts
            
            ↓
            
            Database Missing
            
            ↓
            
            Every Request Fails
            ```
            
            Even though:
            
            ```text
            Worker Nodes
            
            Still Running
            ```
            
            The control plane cannot manage them.
            
            ---
            
