            # Why Snapshots Are Consistent
            
            Remember MVCC.
            
            Suppose:
            
            Current revision:
            
            ```text
            15000
            ```
            
            Snapshot begins.
            
            While the snapshot is running:
            
            ```text
            Revision
            
            15001
            
            15002
            
            15003
            ```
            
            The snapshot still represents:
            
            ```text
            Revision
            
            15000
            ```
            
            Everything inside the snapshot belongs to one consistent database view.
            
