            One etcd member fails.
            
            Example:
            
            ```text
            Member 2
            
            Disk Failure
            ```
            
            Other members:
            
            ```text
            Still Healthy
            ```
            
            Quorum remains.
            
            Recovery is different from restoring the entire cluster.
            
