            ```text
                      Cluster
            
                ┌────────┬────────┬────────┐
            
             Member1   Member2   Member3
            
             Healthy    Failed   Healthy
            
                            │
            
                    Replace Member
            
                            │
            
                    Join Existing Cluster
            ```
            
