            ✔ Automate snapshot creation.
            
            ✔ Encrypt backup files.
            
            ✔ Store backups in multiple locations.
            
            ✔ Verify every backup.
            
            ✔ Test restoration regularly.
            
            ✔ Keep documented recovery procedures.
            
            ✔ Monitor backup success.
            
            ✔ Monitor storage capacity.
            
            ✔ Replace failed members instead of restoring when quorum still exists.
            
            ✔ Practice disaster recovery before a real incident occurs.
            
