            # Why Does Kubernetes Need a Scheduler?
            
            Imagine a Kubernetes cluster with:
            
            ```text
            20 Worker Nodes
            
            ↓
            
            1000 CPU Cores
            
            ↓
            
            4 TB RAM
            
            ↓
            
            500 Pods Waiting
            ```
            
