            # Production Architecture
            
            Highly available clusters usually deploy multiple Scheduler instances.
            
            ```text
                               API Server
            
                        ┌────────┼────────┐
            
                        ▼        ▼        ▼
            
                  Scheduler1 Scheduler2 Scheduler3
            
                        │        │        │
            
                        └────────Leader Election──────┘
            
                                 │
            
                           Active Scheduler
            
                                 │
            
                           Scheduling Pods
            
                                 │
            
                             Bind Requests
            ```
            
            Only one Scheduler instance actively schedules Pods for a given leader-elected scheduler configuration.
            
