            # Scheduling Snapshot
            
            Every scheduling cycle uses:
            
            ```text
            Cluster Snapshot
            
            ↓
            
            Plugin Execution
            
            ↓
            
            Decision
            ```
            
            The snapshot prevents inconsistent scheduling during cluster changes.
            
            ---
            
            # Plugin Failure
            
            Suppose:
            
            ```text
            Volume Plugin
            
            Fails
            ```
            
            Framework decides:
            
            ```text
            Scheduling Failed
            
            ↓
            
            Retry Later
            ```
            
            One failed plugin can reject the scheduling attempt.
            
