            GPU Cluster.
            
            Plugins:
            
            ```text
            NodeResourcesFit
            
            ↓
            
            GPU Plugin
            
            ↓
            
            NodeAffinity
            
            ↓
            
            Score
            ```
            
            Only GPU Nodes survive filtering.
            
