            ↓
            
            PreFilter
            
            ↓
            
            Filter
            
            ↓
            
            Candidate Nodes
            
            ↓
            
            PreScore
            
            ↓
            
            Score
            
            ↓
            
            Winning Node
            
            ↓
            
            Reserve
            
            ↓
            
            Permit
            
            ↓
            
            Binding Cycle
            ```
            
            ---
            
            # Internal Scheduler Workflow
            
            ```text
            while true
            
            ↓
            
            Get Next Pod
            
            ↓
            
