            # Why Scheduling Must Be Fast
            
            Imagine:
            
            ```text
            5,000 Pods
            
            Created
            
            In One Minute
            ```
            
            The Scheduler must:
            
            - Process Pods efficiently
            - Minimize API calls
            - Use cached state
            - Execute filters in parallel
            - Keep scheduling latency low
            
            This is why the Scheduling Cycle is highly optimized.
            
