            # Internal Binding Workflow
            
            ```text
            Selected Node
            
            ↓
            
            PreBind Plugins
            
            ↓
            
            Bind Plugins
            
            ↓
            
            API Server Binding Request
            
            ↓
            
            etcd
            
            ↓
            
            Watch Event
            
            ↓
            
