            # What if Binding Fails?
            
            Failures happen.
            
            Example:
            
            ```text
            API Server
            
            Unavailable
            ```
            
            or
            
            ```text
            Node Deleted
            ```
            
            or
            
            ```text
            PreBind Failed
            ```
            
            or
            
            ```text
            Permission Error
            ```
            
            Binding must not silently fail.
            
            ---
            
            # Failure Scenario 1
            
            Scheduler selected:
            
            ```text
            worker-7
            ```
            
            Before binding:
            
            ```text
            worker-7
            
            ↓
            
            Deleted
            ```
            
            Binding cannot continue.
            
            The scheduling attempt fails.
            
            ---
            
            # Failure Scenario 2
            
            API Server timeout.
            
            ```text
            Scheduler
            
            ↓
            
            Bind Request
            
            ↓
            
            Timeout
            ```
            
            No successful assignment occurs.
            
            ---
            
            # Failure Scenario 3
            
            Storage validation fails.
            
            ```text
            PreBind
            
            ↓
            
            Volume Missing
            ```
            
            Binding stops immediately.
            
            ---
            
            # Failure Scenario 4
            
            Custom Bind Plugin rejects the request.
            
            Example:
            
            ```text
            GPU License
            
            Unavailable
            ```
            
            Result:
            
            ```text
            Binding Failed
            ```
            
