            # Where Does Scoring Fit?
            
            The Scheduling Framework executes:
            
            ```text
            Scheduling Queue
            
            ↓
            
            PreFilter
            
            ↓
            
            Filter
            
            ↓
            
            PreScore
            
            ↓
            
            Score
            
            ↓
            
            Reserve
            
            ↓
            
            Permit
            
            ↓
            
            Bind
