            # Complete Scoring Workflow
            
            ```text
            Candidate Nodes
            
            ↓
            
            Score Plugins
            
            ↓
            
            Normalization
            
            ↓
            
            Apply Plugin Weights
            
            ↓
            
            Aggregate Scores
            
            ↓
            
            Highest Score
            
            ↓
            
            Selected Node
            
            ↓
            
            Reserve
            
            ↓
            
            Permit
            
            ↓
            
            Bind
            ```
            
