            High-level algorithm:
            
            ```text
            Incoming Pod
            
            ↓
            
            Normal Scheduling
            
            ↓
            
            Candidate Found?
            
            │
            
            ├── Yes
            
            │
            
            ▼
            
            Bind
            
            │
            
            └── No
            
                  │
            
                  ▼
            
            Preemption
            
                  │
            
                  ▼
            
            Find Candidate Nodes
            
                  │
            
                  ▼
            
            Find Victims
            
                  │
            
                  ▼
            
            Respect PDB When Possible
            
                  │
            
                  ▼
            
            Choose Best Node
            
                  │
            
                  ▼
            
            Set Nominated Node
            
                  │
            
                  ▼
            
            Evict Victims
            
                  │
            
                  ▼
            
            Retry Scheduling
            
                  │
            
                  ▼
            
            Bind
            ```
            
