            # Chapter 1 — Introduction to Controllers
            
            > **Goal:** Understand the fundamental concept of Kubernetes Controllers, why they exist, how they continuously reconcile the cluster toward its desired state, and how the Controller Manager orchestrates dozens of built-in controllers to automate cluster operations.
            
