            # Controller Manager Architecture
            
            Instead of running one Controller,
            
            Kubernetes runs many Controllers.
            
            They are managed by:
            
            ```text
            kube-controller-manager
            ```
            
            ---
            
            # High-Level Architecture
            
            ```text
                          kube-controller-manager
            
                                    │
            
             ┌──────────────────────┼──────────────────────┐
            
             ▼                      ▼                      ▼
            
            Deployment        ReplicaSet             Job
            
            Controller         Controller         Controller
            
             ▼                      ▼                      ▼
            
            StatefulSet       CronJob              Node
            
            Controller        Controller        Controller
            ```
            
            Each Controller has a specific responsibility.
            
            ---
            
            # Why Separate Controllers?
            
            Suppose one Controller managed everything.
            
            Responsibilities:
            
            ```text
            Deployments
            
            Pods
            
            Jobs
            
            Nodes
            
            Storage
            
            Networking
            ```
            
            This would become extremely complex.
            
            Instead,
            
            Kubernetes follows the Unix philosophy:
            
            ```text
            One Component
            
            One Responsibility
            ```
            
            ---
            
            # Built-in Controllers
            
            The Controller Manager contains dozens of Controllers.
            
            Some of the most important include:
            
            | Controller | Responsibility |
            |------------|----------------|
            | ReplicaSet Controller | Maintain replica count |
            | Deployment Controller | Rolling updates and ReplicaSets |
            | StatefulSet Controller | Stable identities and ordered deployment |
            | DaemonSet Controller | One Pod per eligible Node |
            | Job Controller | Run finite tasks to completion |
            | CronJob Controller | Schedule Jobs |
            | Node Controller | Monitor Node health |
            | Namespace Controller | Cleanup deleted namespaces |
            | ServiceAccount Controller | Create default ServiceAccounts |
            | EndpointSlice Controller | Maintain service endpoints |
            
            Each Controller watches different resources.
            
