            # Controller Relationships
            
            Controllers cooperate.
            
            Example:
            
            ```text
            Deployment
            
            ↓
            
            Deployment Controller
            
            ↓
            
            ReplicaSet
            
            ↓
            
            ReplicaSet Controller
            
            ↓
            
            Pods
            
            ↓
            
            kubelet
            ```
            
