            # Relationship with Previous Chapters
            
            ```text
            User
            
            ↓
            
            Desired State
            
            ↓
            
            API Server
            
            ↓
            
            Controller
            
            ↓
            
            Reconciliation Loop
            
            ↓
            
            Scheduler
            
            ↓
            
            kubelet
            
            ↓
            
            Running Workload
            ```
            
            Reconciliation is the engine that keeps the entire system aligned with user intent.
            
