            # Production Example 1
            
            Three Control Plane Nodes
            
            ```text
            Node 1
            
            Controller Manager
            
            Leader
            
            Node 2
            
            Controller Manager
            
            Standby
            
            Node 3
            
            Controller Manager
            
            Standby
