            # Step 4 — Reconcile()
            
            This is where your business logic lives.
            
            Everything else supports this function.
            
            ---
            
            # Reconcile Loop
            
            ```text
            Receive Request
            
            ↓
            
            Read Resource
            
            ↓
            
            Compare Desired
            
            ↓
            
            Compare Actual
            
            ↓
            
            Need Changes?
            
             │
            
             ├── No
            
             │
            
             ▼
            
            Return
            
             │
            
             └── Yes
            
                  │
            
                  ▼
            
            Update Cluster
            ```
            
            ---
            
            # Typical Reconcile Logic
            
            Conceptually:
            
            ```text
            Read Database
            
            ↓
            
            StatefulSet Exists?
            
             │
            
             ├── No
            
             │
            
             ▼
            
            Create
            
             │
            
             └── Yes
            
                  │
            
                  ▼
            
            Compare
            
            ↓
            
            Update
            
            ↓
            
            Status
            
            ↓
            
            Return
            ```
            
            ---
            
            # Idempotency
            
            Reconcile should always be:
            
            ```text
            Idempotent
            ```
            
            Running:
            
            ```text
            Once
            
            or
            
            100 Times
            ```
            
            must produce the same desired state.
            
            ---
            
            # Why?
            
            Suppose:
            
            ```text
            Network Timeout
            
            ↓
            
            Controller Retries
            ```
            
            The retry must be safe.
            
            ---
            
            # Step 5 — OwnerReferences
            
            Controllers create child resources.
            
            Example:
            
            ```text
            Database
            
            ↓
            
            StatefulSet
            
            ↓
            
            Pods
            ```
            
            Relationships should be explicit.
            
            ---
            
            # OwnerReference Architecture
            
            ```text
            Database CR
            
            ↓
            
            OwnerReference
            
            ↓
            
            StatefulSet
            
            ↓
            
            OwnerReference
            
            ↓
            
            Pods
            ```
            
            ---
            
            # Why OwnerReferences?
            
            Benefits:
            
            - Automatic garbage collection
            - Event mapping
            - Ownership tracking
            - Easier debugging
            
            ---
            
            # Example
            
            Delete:
            
            ```text
            Database
            ```
            
            Garbage Collector automatically removes:
            
            ```text
            StatefulSet
            
            ↓
            
            Pods
            
            ↓
            
            Services
            ```
            
            assuming appropriate ownership relationships.
            
