            # Module 1.6 — kubelet Internals
            
            # Chapter 1 — kubelet Architecture & Node Registration
            
            > **Goal:** Understand the internal architecture of the Kubernetes **kubelet**, the primary Node Agent responsible for executing Pods on every Kubernetes Node. Learn how kubelet starts, registers a Node, communicates with the control plane, maintains Node health, updates heartbeats, and continuously manages workloads.
            
            ---
            
            # Learning Objectives
            
