            ---
            
            # Prerequisites
            
            Before reading this chapter, you should understand:
            
            - Kubernetes Architecture
            - API Server
            - Scheduler
            - Controller Manager
            - Pods
            - Nodes
            - etcd
            - Container Runtime Interface (basic understanding)
            
