            Modern Kubernetes typically uses:
            
            ```text
            kubelet
            
            ↓
            
            CRI
            
            ↓
            
            containerd
            
            ↓
            
            runc
            
            ↓
            
            Linux Kernel
            ```
            
            Each layer has a specific responsibility.
            
            ---
            
            # Layered Architecture
            
            ```text
            +--------------------------------+
            
                    Kubernetes
            
            +--------------------------------+
            
                         kubelet
            
            +--------------------------------+
            
