            The kubelet requests:
            
            ```text
            StartContainer
            ```
            
            ---
            
            # Step 9
            
            The runtime asks the OCI runtime (such as runc) to start the process.
            
            ---
            
            # Step 10
            
            Linux starts:
            
            ```text
            Application Process
            ```
            
            The Pod is now running.
            
