            # Image Pull Secrets
            
            Kubernetes stores registry credentials in:
            
            ```text
            Secret
            
            ↓
            
            type:
            
            kubernetes.io/dockerconfigjson
            ```
            
            The Secret is referenced by the Pod.
            
            ---
            
            # Pod Example
            
            Conceptually:
            
            ```yaml
            imagePullSecrets:
            
            - name: registry-secret
            ```
            
            The kubelet passes authentication information to the runtime.
            
