            # ImagePullBackOff
            
            One of the most common Kubernetes errors.
            
            Workflow:
            
            ```text
            Pull Image
            
            ↓
            
            Failure
            
            ↓
            
            Retry
            
            ↓
            
            Backoff
            
            ↓
            
            Retry Again
            ```
            
            The retry interval gradually increases to avoid overwhelming the registry.
            
            ---
            
            # Image Cache Reuse
            
            Suppose:
            
            ```text
            10 Pods
            
            ↓
            
            Same Image
            ```
            
            containerd downloads the image once.
            
            ```text
            Image
            
            ↓
            
            Cache
            
            ↓
            
            Shared
            
            ↓
            
            10 Containers
            ```
            
            ---
            
            # Image Updates
            
            Suppose:
            
            ```text
            Image
            
            Version 1
            ```
            
            Later:
            
            ```text
            Version 2
            ```
            
            The runtime downloads only new layers.
            
            Shared layers remain cached.
            
