            # Image Garbage Collection
            
            Nodes have limited disk space.
            
            Eventually:
            
            ```text
            Images
            
            ↓
            
            Grow
            
            ↓
            
            Disk Full
            ```
            
            The kubelet manages image garbage collection to reclaim storage.
            
            ---
            
            # Why Garbage Collection?
            
            Suppose:
            
            ```text
            Daily Deployments
            
            ↓
            
            New Images
            
            ↓
            
            Old Images
            
            ↓
            
            Disk Usage
            
            ↓
            
            100%
            ```
            
            Eventually new images cannot be pulled.
            
            ---
            
            # Garbage Collection Workflow
            
            ```text
            Disk Usage
            
            ↓
            
            Threshold Crossed
            
            ↓
            
            kubelet
            
            ↓
            
            Identify Unused Images
            
            ↓
            
            Delete Old Images
            
            ↓
            
            Free Space
            ```
            
            ---
            
            # Which Images are Removed?
            
            The kubelet removes:
            
            ```text
            Unused Images
            
            ↓
            
            Old Images
            
            ↓
            
            No Running Containers
            ```
            
            Images currently used by running containers are not removed.
            
            ---
            
            # Image vs Snapshot
            
            Do not confuse:
            
            ```text
            Image
            
            ↓
            
            Read-Only
            
            ────────────
            
            Snapshot
            
            ↓
            
            Writable Layer
            ```
            
            Deleting an unused image does not affect running containers that are actively using their existing snapshots.
            
