            # Modern Runtime Architecture
            
            Today a cluster may contain:
            
            ```text
            Pod A
            
            ↓
            
            runc
            
            ────────────
            
            Pod B
            
            ↓
            
            gVisor
            
            ────────────
            
            Pod C
            
            ↓
            
            Kata Containers
            ```
            
            Each Pod uses the runtime best suited to its requirements.
            
