            # Production Best Practices
            
            ✔ Use EndpointSlices for backend discovery.
            
            ✔ Monitor iptables rule count in large clusters.
            
            ✔ Understand Hairpin NAT before debugging Service networking.
            
            ✔ Monitor rule synchronization latency.
            
            ✔ Prefer immutable infrastructure—let kube-proxy manage rules instead of modifying them manually.
            
            ✔ Verify that Node firewall rules do not interfere with Kubernetes-managed chains.
            
