            # The Problem
            
            Suppose you want to create a Database Operator.
            
            Without Kubebuilder, you would manually create:
            
            ```text
            CRD YAML
            
            ↓
            
            Go Types
            
            ↓
            
            DeepCopy Functions
            
            ↓
            
            Controller
            
            ↓
            
            Manager
            
            ↓
            
            Scheme
            
            ↓
            
            RBAC
            
            ↓
            
            Deployment YAML
            
            ↓
            
