            Kubebuilder generates deployment manifests.
            
            Typical deployment:
            
            ```text
            Operator
            
            ↓
            
            Deployment
            
            ↓
            
            Leader Election
            
            ↓
            
            Metrics
            
            ↓
            
            Health Probes
            ```
            
            The Operator runs like any other Kubernetes application.
            
