            ```text
            kubectl apply
            
            ↓
            
            Deployment
            
            ↓
            
            Pod
            
            ↓
            
            Manager
            
            ↓
            
            Controllers
            
            ↓
            
            Watch Cluster
            ```
            
            ---
            
            # Complete Architecture
            
            ```text
                        Kubebuilder CLI
            
                               │
            
                               ▼
            
                     Generate Project
            
                               │
            
                               ▼
            
                    controller-runtime
            
                               │
            
                     ┌─────────┼─────────┐
            
                     ▼         ▼         ▼
            
                  Manager    Client    Cache
            
                     │
            
                     ▼
            
                Reconciler
            
                     │
            
                     ▼
            
