            | ValidatingAdmissionPolicy | Validating Webhook |
            |--------------------------|--------------------|
            | CEL | Any programming language |
            | Runs inside API Server | External Service |
            | No HTTPS | HTTPS required |
            | Declarative | Fully programmable |
            | Lower latency | Higher latency |
            
