            # Most Common Production Issues
            
            | Problem | Root Cause |
            |----------|------------|
            | Sidecar missing | Mutating webhook not matched |
            | Labels missing | JSON Patch failed |
            | Pod rejected | Validation policy denied |
            | Admission timeout | Slow webhook |
            | TLS error | Invalid certificate |
            | Quota exceeded | ResourceQuota |
            | Namespace error | NamespaceLifecycle |
            | StorageClass assigned unexpectedly | DefaultStorageClass |
            | API requests slow | Too many webhooks or slow webhook logic |
            | Validation skipped | Failure Policy set to `Ignore` after webhook failure or webhook did not match |
            
